    done: 1
    version: 1.0.0
    status: pass
    note: 'Astra, 2026-10-19: make the booth and phone look real and handcrafted.
      Hero prop for PC: budget raised to 30k triangles and 2048 px (booth atlas);
      5 materials, 400 particles as she chose'
    doneAt: 2026-10-19T07:23:29Z
    doneBy: Claude (agent)
    details: liminal-doors-phone-booth v1.0.0 (prop) for PC; budget 30000 triangles,
      5 materials, 2048 px, 400 particles
